                            <comment id="17016158" author="ivan.glukos" created="Wed, 15 Jan 2020 17:13:50 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=alex_pl&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;alex_pl&quot;&gt;alex_pl&lt;/a&gt; Thanks for your patch, I totally agree with the solution.&lt;br/&gt;
I&apos;d propose to add a test where we check that after intensive multithreaded load and after checkpoint cache limit counter&apos;s value is equal to its maximum level (totalPages * threshold). Thus we&apos;ll check that for every increment there&apos;s a decrement.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
